  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img height=\"137\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/68982c09-79a7-4762-994c-a72716815c0f-image.png\" width=\"144\" />&nbsp;</p><p>For a uniform rectangular sheet shown in the figure, the ratio of moments of inertia about the axes perpendicular to the sheet and passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;(the centre of mass) and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&#39; (corner point) is:</p>",
    "image": null
