  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We will use Parallel Axes Theorem here,</p><p>Distance between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mo>'</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>So, according to parallel axis theorem we have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p>",
